            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="fact-item">
            <div class="fact-emoji">🎵</div>
            <div class="fact-text">
              <strong>Mockingbirds</strong> can learn and mimic over 200 different songs, including car alarms, cell phones, and other bird species!
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="fact-item">
            <div class="fact-emoji">❤️</div>
            <div class="fact-text">
